WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.629
(Wind howling)

00:00:03.629 --> 00:00:05.797
Milchick:
Okay, go ahead and have a seat.

00:00:06.089 --> 00:00:06.757
(Click)

00:00:06.757 --> 00:00:08.008
♪♪

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:08.842
(Clearing throat)

00:00:09.092 --> 00:00:10.385
My name is Mark S.

00:00:10.552 --> 00:00:11.803
I'm Helly R.

00:00:12.054 --> 00:00:13.347
My name is Irving B.

00:00:13.597 --> 00:00:14.598
My name is Dylan G.

00:00:14.932 --> 00:00:17.434
And I have of my own free
accord

00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:19.102
elected to undergo the
procedure

00:00:19.102 --> 00:00:20.312
known as severance.

00:00:21.355 --> 00:00:21.855
Awesome.

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:23.273
♪♪

00:00:23.273 --> 00:00:25.943
Mark S.
I give consent for the Lumon
corporation

00:00:25.943 --> 00:00:28.195
Irving B:
and it's a good corporation.

00:00:28.195 --> 00:00:30.530
Helly R:
To sever my memories between my
work life...

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:31.448
♪♪

00:00:31.448 --> 00:00:32.074
Mark S:
Oh!

00:00:32.366 --> 00:00:33.367
Mark S:
...and my personal life.

00:00:33.951 --> 00:00:34.534
(Laughing)

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:36.662
Dylan G:
I acknowledge that once the
procedure is complete

00:00:37.329 --> 00:00:40.499
Irving B:
I will be unable to access my
personal memories

00:00:40.499 --> 00:00:42.709
Mark S:
whilst on Lumon's severed floor.

00:00:42.709 --> 00:00:45.254
♪♪

00:00:45.254 --> 00:00:47.464
Mark S:
Nor will I retain work memories 

00:00:47.464 --> 00:00:49.174
Dylan G:
when I return home at the end of
the day.

00:00:49.174 --> 00:00:50.467
♪♪

00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:55.097
Helly R:
I am aware that this
alteration is comprehensive and irreversible.

00:00:55.097 --> 00:00:59.351
♪♪

00:00:59.351 --> 00:01:01.270
All:
I make these statements freely.

00:01:01.270 --> 00:01:03.438
♪♪

00:01:03.438 --> 00:01:05.524
Milchick:
Okay, that's a wrap.

00:01:05.524 --> 00:01:07.276
♪♪

00:01:07.276 --> 00:01:08.777
(Door opening)

00:01:08.777 --> 00:01:10.696
Um, open or closed?

00:01:10.696 --> 00:01:14.199
♪♪

00:01:14.199 --> 00:01:14.866
Both.

00:01:14.866 --> 00:01:16.785
♪♪

